%% Mermaid diagram: Validator Consensus Flow
flowchart TD
    A[Threat entry in Suspected/Review state] --> B[Retrieve evidence]
    B --> C[Verify digests and derive normalized representation]
    C --> D[LLM validator analysis]
    D --> E[Generate signed recommendation]
    E --> F[Consensus controller aggregates recommendations]
    F --> G{Quorum achieved?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Update lifecycle state]
    G -- No --> I[Await more proposals / retain state]